1973  *==============================================================================================================
1974  *RESULTS
1975  *==============================================================================================================
1976  *run_coalitions.py reads EcOm, EnOm, res, OBJ_run and the MOO stores from the GDX of each run, and the variables at each
1977  *MOO point from point_<point>.gdx
1978  Sets
1979  item            Results of the Coalition solved /'model status', 'EcO', 'EnO'/
1980  OBJ_run         Objective minimised in this run (--OBJ) /MOO/;
1981   
1982  Parameters
